# Build output stays out of the repository; Go's shared caches hold everything else.
*.exe
/bin/
/out/
# Output of scripts/bench-go.ps1: raw benchmark runs, summaries and profiles.
/bench-results/
# Release output of jamb package, written to <app>/dist.
dist/
*.prof
*.test
coverage.out

# Screenshots saved by JAMB_SCRIPT "shot" or internal/iconsheet into the repository
# root. docs/screenshots is tracked and is not matched by this pattern.
/*.png

# Local Claude Code configuration and design notes; not part of the project.
.claude/
/docs/spec.md

# OS metadata
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
